{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Manage your own video store and turn your business into a retro success!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this laid-back management simulator, you're in charge of a store dedicated to selling physical movies. Buy, organize, sell, and improve your video store while enjoying a nostalgic experience inspired by the golden age of home entertainment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Buy and Sell Movies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose which titles to add to your catalog, adjust pricing, and offer a variety of options to attract more customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638630/extras/ezgif-439921d39add39.gif?t=1744071236\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Organize Your Shelves </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place your movies on the store\u2019s shelves and define the layout and display style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638630/extras/ezgif-3a497c584aeffe.gif?t=1744071236\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customize Your Video Store\u00a0<i>(in development)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decorate the space with unique visual elements to make your shop stand out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638630/extras/decora.gif?t=1744071236\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Inventory System <i>(in development)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep track of how many copies you have of each title, manage stock, and plan your restocks efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>This version represents an early sample of the game in development. Content may be expanded or adjusted in the final release.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.s